\subsection{Examples}\label{ss:ex}

We run the tableau on two formulas (Figure~\ref{fig:ex}) that exercise the {double cover}: an outer $\mathrm{AG}$ (a
release) re-demands an inner timed until, so the cover rule fires twice.  In Figure~\ref{fig:ex}, each node shows its goals $\Gamma$ (with carried $\AX$-context markers where space permits) and its zone, while edge labels name the rule applied.

